{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1763154711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/19e2499c0ce61a1ffc2c701e657141d5.avif?t=1763154711 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hail, Sir Knight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King has bequeathed unto thee royal lands as reward for thy faithful service. However, these lands are untamed, with its subjects rejecting thy rule as if they weren't a part of the kingdom. As a faithful vassal of thy lord, take up thy sword and conquer these lands and bring them under thy rule, as is thy right!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1763154711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/ca82553631e012e16897b58daaa6942e.avif?t=1763154711 width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.poster.avif?t=1763154711\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.webm?t=1763154711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/180ee63db1e290b75ca310955ec86b96.mp4?t=1763154711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your holdings by managing resources and buildings. Each building has a purpose that unlocks greater advantages for your town and for your campaign, whether if it's a simple house for your peasant populations, or a grand marketplace to open up a town to trade and resources that are otherwise not available in the town. Construct walls and defenses to defend your holdings from invaders and develop them in order to bring more resources and manpower for your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.poster.avif?t=1763154711\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.webm?t=1763154711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/caaa474e126936a184a4d0671e036bd9.mp4?t=1763154711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your own skill as a knight and upgrade your equipment as you progress through your journey as a knight. Whether it be improving your personal martial skills, or increasing your ability to lead bigger retinues, investing in your knight will allow you greater power and ability to conquer other lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/9c46cf46a6a12e0b0abe0f1a1e11b8b3.avif?t=1763154711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/9c46cf46a6a12e0b0abe0f1a1e11b8b3.avif?t=1763154711 width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need soldiers if you want to destroy anything larger than a bandit group. Levy from your peasant population a basic army, though at the cost of not being able to put them to work, and lead them in battle against enemy forces. Different units are strong or weak against varying enemy types, so choose your army well. With more development and resources, you may even recruit professional soldiers that are superior to the levies, and don't take away from the labor pool, although their cost is higher than a simple peasant recruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1763154711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/extras_big/25ad5489dfd81541efb1358ad5c1db41.avif?t=1763154711 width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, or rather all the time, it's more fun to play with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your fellow knights into your game to assist you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up your holdings among your friends, who can in turn help you manage your realm as it grows, and assist you in battle with their own armies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the realm with your knight friends!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shenanigans Await!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/a467cbe12b737d93a3d620e08b9b68bdfae92ec0.jpg"},{"name":"A Fellowship of Knights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/ad1ecbbd5d4d080056004e3ed52f0f2c700196fa.jpg"},{"name":"Yer a Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/227d3da54491d881cdb454f6717b8bff50b3b56e.jpg"},{"name":"Darkness Defeater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/4977c846c307eceecc74be3001ebe7000913c6c8.jpg"},{"name":"Frostking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/f941d2806d6942d815bb158cb3c5d5b2bbb9c5ed.jpg"},{"name":"That's How You Swing a Hammer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/3cbeea43cf29b9c729dd93220e4747f021b72bb9.jpg"},{"name":"The Grand Army","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/3d04216ef4c60aca08359939f912f7c231fbcb92.jpg"},{"name":"Consecrated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/c00a1da83cbb780de55ff6fd3a68a624974e349e.jpg"},{"name":"Hall of Knights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/746bf8f231f6994c7681dcd574ac78e5e2eb72be.jpg"},{"name":"Knight of Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2782030/e74f127803298a65532fd3244374bf276bd2e75d.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2782030?t=1763154711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2782030?t=1763154711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/74f288bc28f4ade0c73269dad4feb5fc81062958/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763154711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782030/74f288bc28f4ade0c73269dad4feb5fc81062958/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763154711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3449090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 